CardTenderType.description:
Identifies the card-rail tender the API caller, VT user, or HPP cardholder is
attempting to use. Drives processor routing decisions deterministically;
gateway never infers EBT/eWIC tender from BIN data.

voidReason.description:
Why the reduced authorization was voided, for the merchant audit trail. Only meaningful
when Phoenix.SharedModels.Transaction.PartialApprovalData.Disposition is Phoenix.SharedModels.Transaction.PartialApprovalDisposition.Voided;
null otherwise.

PaymentPlanStatus.description:
Lifecycle of an invoice payment plan — a schedule that splits an issued invoice's outstanding
balance into a series of dated installments. Only meaningful on invoices that carry a plan;
invoices without one have no plan state.

nextPaymentAmount.description:
The exact amount the payer must submit for the next payment. When a deposit is still outstanding
this is the deposit amount (the pay surface collects exactly this, not an arbitrary partial);
otherwise it is the remaining WinkPG.Invoicing.PublicInvoiceViewDto.BalanceDue.

linkedChargeKind.description:
Why this transaction exists as a separate linked charge (currently only
            ), or null when
            it is not a linked charge. Server-state; read-only on the wire.

value.description:
Value captured for the field. At most 300 characters and free of control characters;
printable punctuation is accepted. Any narrower format constraint comes from the regular
expression and maximum length on the merchant's field definition.
